<programme start="20261017195300 +0000" stop="20261017214100 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">Hatching</title><sub-title lang="es">Hatching</sub-title><desc lang="es">After finding a wounded bird, a girl brings its strange egg home and nurtures it until it hatches. The creature that emerges soon becomes her closest friend and a living nightmare, plunging her into a twisted reality that her mother refuses to see.</desc><credits><director>Hanna Bergholm</director><actor>Siiri Solalinna</actor><actor>Sophia Heikkilä</actor><actor>Jani Volanen</actor><actor>Reino Nordin</actor><actor>Oiva Ollila</actor><actor>Ida Määttänen</actor><actor>Saija Lentonen</actor><actor>Miroslava Agejeva</actor></credits><date>19010101</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/ec74d10365646979e0cd7b1d4d7bfe42.jpeg"/></programme>
