<programme start="20261015100000 +0000" stop="20261015120000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Christmas on Every Page</title><desc lang="es">A woman returns home for the holidays to help her mother&apos;s struggling bookstore. As she reconnects with her roots, she starts to question whether success is measured by career milestones -- or by love, creativity, and the joy of truly belonging.</desc><credits><actor>Rose Reid</actor><actor>Jake Allyn</actor></credits><date>20250101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Christmas</category><category lang="es">Drama</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/"/></programme>
<programme start="20261015120000 +0000" stop="20261015140000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">A Brush With Christmas</title><desc lang="es">Disheartened and struggling to find time for her art, Charlotte throws out her latest painting, only to discover that it has been anonymously submitted to the Christmas art festival.</desc><credits><actor>Jillian Murray</actor><actor>Joseph Cannata</actor><actor>Jan Skene</actor></credits><date>20220101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Christmas</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p23569253_st_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261015140000 +0000" stop="20261015160000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">A Royal Christmas Holiday</title><desc lang="es">An ambitious reporter tracks down a prince who is in town for the dedication of a naval museum honoring his late grandfather. She convinces him to show his followers that his work is more than just a job, and the two begin to fall for each other.</desc><credits><actor>Brittany Underwood</actor><actor>Jonathan Stoddard</actor><actor>William Baldwin</actor></credits><date>20230101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Christmas</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25951079_k_h8_ab.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261015160000 +0000" stop="20261015180000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">A Christmas Less Traveled</title><desc lang="es">An old audio cassette of her dad&apos;s voice sends a woman on a journey to retrace her family&apos;s most memorable moments. Along the way, she meets a man who offers her a generous payment in exchange for a ride to close the most important deal of his life.</desc><credits><actor>Candace Cameron Bure</actor><actor>Eric Johnson</actor><actor>Josh Collins</actor></credits><date>20240101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Christmas</category><category lang="es">Drama</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p28482999_i_s4_aa.jpg"/></programme>
