<programme start="20261016100000 +0000" stop="20261016110000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">&apos;57 Chevy Two-Day Turnaround!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The guys take a big-block &apos;57 Bel Air to compete in the autocross at Cruisin&apos; the Coast in Miss.; with a complete overhaul of the suspension in the event&apos;s parking lot, the guys find out how much lap time they can shave in a weekend.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_h8_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016110000 +0000" stop="20261016120000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">V-8 Baja Bug Suspension Overhaul!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Off-road legend Cameron Steele warned the guys that a V-8 swap wouldn&apos;t cut as much time as a long-travel suspension could; now Newbern and Cotten finally heed his advice, going all-out with major suspension upgrades to their Baja-inspired VW Beetle.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016120000 +0000" stop="20261016130000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Drag Racing Model A!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The guys take on Clay Millican by transforming a Model A from the ground up; with a new chassis, suspension and fresh 400-hp 347ci V-8, the Ford is improved in every way.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_s4_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016130000 +0000" stop="20261016140000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Turbocharged Eagle Rally Racer!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Newbern and Cotten discover a gem which is not a typical American muscle with a turbocharged Eagle Talon; Shea Seefeldt challenges the guys on a rally course with his LS-swapped Subaru.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_s4_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016140000 +0000" stop="20261016150000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Monte Carlo Circle Track Surprise</sub-title><desc lang="en">Newbern surprises Cotten with a mint 1984 G-body and an &apos;80s-style, stock-car-inspired build to take on an actual former cup car around the circle track.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016150000 +0000" stop="20261016160000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Pro Street Mirada Makeover!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Cotten&apos;s Pro Street big-block 1980 Dodge Mirada&apos;s engine dies on Roadkill; things don&apos;t go as planned as the guys attempt to add a giant blower and bigger tires, and bring the car back to its 1990s-era glory.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016160000 +0000" stop="20261016170000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Tough Truck Mail Jeep!</sub-title><desc lang="en">When Grave Digger himself calls you out, there&apos;s only one thing to do, send it; the guys send it by transforming a stock 1972 Jeep into a Tough Truck competitor to challenge the field at Dennis Anderson&apos;s Muddy Motorsports Park in North Carolina.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016170000 +0000" stop="20261016180000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Top-Speed Trans Am!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The guys attempt to build their &apos;99 Trans Am into a 200-mph club member to compete at the Arkansas Mile; Keith Turk helps the guys find out how much horsepower they need to make, and they begin one of their most complex builds yet.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016180000 +0000" stop="20261016190000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Pigpen vs. Crown Hick: Battle of the Body Swaps!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The guys take on Hot Rod Garage&apos;s Lucky Costa and improve their shop truck Pigpen; it&apos;s their LS7-powered 1950 GMC 100 on an S15 chassis versus Lucky&apos;s 1966 Ford F-100 with a supercharged 4.6L on a police car chassis known as the Crown Hick.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016190000 +0000" stop="20261016200000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Shocking Gains and Boosting the &apos;60 Biscayne!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The guys take a 1960 Chevrolet Biscayne and completely overhaul the suspension with an unconventional setup and supercharge the engine to make up time against a &apos;66 Mustang GT350.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016200000 +0000" stop="20261016210000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">Hemi-Powered Monte Carlo!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Newbern and Cotten take a G-Body to new heights when they swap a third-gen Hemi into a 1984 Monte Carlo.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016210000 +0000" stop="20261016220000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Faster With Newbern and Cotten</title><sub-title lang="en">200mph Trans AM!</sub-title><desc lang="en">What does it take to get a Trans Am to 200 mph? The guys swing for the fences in an attempt at the elusive top speed of 200 mph.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25346141_b_v12_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016220000 +0000" stop="20261016230000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Roadkill Garage</title><sub-title lang="en">Bootleg Ford Fixing and Road Trip!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Freiburger and Dulcich death-proof their questionably assembled &apos;40 Ford Fordor, then hit the road to multiple junkyards to hunt for a new project vehicle; after a lengthy search, they fall in love with a barn-find &apos;60s truck that&apos;s too good.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p17798143_b_v11_af.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016230000 +0000" stop="20261017000000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Roadkill Garage</title><sub-title lang="en">Muscle Truck 4-Link Fabrication!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The &apos;73 Chevy step-side muscle truck has a storied history; Freiburger and guest host Dave Chappelle fabricate another chapter in the truck&apos;s saga with the addition of a beefy four-link suspension and coilovers to hopefully get it to sit right.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p17798143_b_v11_af.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261017000000 +0000" stop="20261017010000 +0000" channel="Motor Trend"><title lang="en">Roadkill Garage</title><sub-title lang="en">1000+ hp Pro Street Nova!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Freiburger and Dulcich add 1,000+ hp to David&apos;s Pro Street 1969 Chevy Nova; in an attempt to make a true street/strip car, the guys fully build out this roller before taking it to the track to run some impressive times out of the gate.</desc><category lang="en">Automotive</category><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p17798143_b_v11_af.jpg"/></programme>
