<programme start="20261015180000 +0000" stop="20261015210000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">San Francisco 49ers at Seattle Seahawks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Seahawks (3-1) host the 49ers (4-0) in NFL Week 5 at Lumen Field. San Francisco arrives atop the NFC West, but Seattle won the last meeting here 41-6 in January. Seattle looks to Sam Darnold, who has 560 passing yards and six TDs this season.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
