<programme start="20261015230000 +0000" stop="20261016000000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Replay</title><sub-title lang="en">Super Bowl XLVIII: Denver Broncos vs. Seattle Seahawks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Seahawks, behind their top-ranked defense, help deliver the first Super Bowl in franchise history by beating Peyton Manning and the Denver Broncos 43-8. From Feb. 2, 2014 in New York.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p267748_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016000000 +0000" stop="20261016030000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Buffalo Bills at Los Angeles Rams</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Rams host the Bills at SoFi Stadium. Buffalo lost its previous game to New England 29-26, while the Rams have alternated wins and losses. The Rams rely on Matthew Stafford, who has six touchdowns; Buffalo looks to Josh Allen, who has six as well.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
