<programme start="20261015180000 +0000" stop="20261015190000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Combat Ships</title><sub-title lang="en">Viking Longships</sub-title><desc lang="en">The story of one of the world&apos;s most effective war machines: the Viking longship, seeing how its design evolved from swift war canoe to versatile and feared ship that would change the course of history.</desc><credits><actor>Ben Major</actor></credits><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13658854_b_v12_ai.jpg"/></programme>
